[14.819112, "o", "rning.apple.com/work-with-us) and a data scientist and the second full-time \u001b[m \b\u001b[31memployee at [HealthRhythms](https://www.healthrhythms.com). \u001b[m\u001b[m\r\n\\ No newline at end of file\u001b[m\u001b[m\r\n\u001b[32m+\u001b[m\u001b[32mPreviously, I was a Student Researcher at [Google Research](https://research.google/), an ML Research Intern at [Apple Health AI](https://machinelearning.apple\u001b[m \b\u001b[32m\u001b[m\u001b[32m.com/work-with-us) and a data scientist and the second full-time employee at [HealthRhythms](https://www.healthrhythms.com).\u001b[m\u001b[41m \u001b[m\u001b[m\r\n\\ No newline at end of file\u001b[m\u001b[m\r\n\u001b[1mdiff --git a/_layouts/default.html b/_layouts/default.html\u001b[m\u001b[m\r\n\u001b[1mindex 3fe07ee..cff5b5e 100644\u001b[m\u001b[m\r\n\u001b[1m--- a/_layouts/default.html\u001b[m\u001b[m\r\n\u001b[1m+++ b/_layouts/default.html\u001b[m\u001b[m\r\n\u001b[36m@@ -27,7 +27,9 @@\u001b[m\u001b[m\r\n     <link href=\"css/bootstrap.min.css\" rel=\"stylesheet\">\u001b[m\u001b[m\r\n     <link href=\"css/style.css\" rel=\"stylesheet\">\u001b[m\u001b[m\r\n \u001b[m\u001b[m\r\n\u001b[31m-    <link href=\"https://fonts.googleapis.com/css?family=Noto+Sans+HK:100,300|Barlow+Condensed|PT+Mono|PT+Serif&d"]
